summary:
  "rock" typed into the search fills the page from station names alone again.

history:
  The name answer for a genre word has fifty rows, the page's thirty fill
  from them and the tag pass only ran with room left: 17 of the 30 biggest
  rock-tagged stations were never shown, and "Show more" paged more names.
  Of the name answer only the stations named after the word lead now; this
  takes the filter away.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
          const lead = (mode === "all" && cc === "") ? SearchLogic.leadRows(q) : null

replace:
          const lead = null

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_a_genre_word_is_asked_of_the_tags_and_only_its_namesakes_lead.
  Line-neutral.
